## Decisions Made
| Decision | Why | Alternatives Considered |
|----------|-----|------------------------|
| UEditorSubsystem (not actor) | Survives map changes, no level dependency, auto-creates with editor | SceneCapture2D actor (re-renders scene, doubles GPU cost) |
| Separate HTTP server on 30011 | RemoteControl route registration API poorly documented; FHttpServerModule works cleanly | Piggyback on RemoteControl port 30010 (couldn't find route registration API) |
| Full includes in subsystem header (not forward decls) | UHT-generated .gen.cpp needs complete types for TUniquePtr destructor | Forward declarations (caused C4150 incomplete type errors) |
| FTextureRHIRef not FTexture2DRHIRef | UE5.7 unified texture RHI refs | FTexture2DRHIRef (removed in 5.7) |
| FTSTicker::FDelegateHandle (not FDelegateHandle) | Different types in UE5.7 ticker system | FDelegateHandle (type mismatch) |
| JPEG default, 85 quality | Good balance of size (~96KB) and quality for AI perception | PNG (larger, lossless -- overkill for AI consumption) |

